# Animations

## Workflow (strict)

1. Static UI → 2. Responsive → 3. A11y → 4. GSAP/Three → 5. Perf → 6. Cross-browser

Do not use motion to hide layout bugs.

## Library roles

| Lib | Owns |
|-----|------|
| Lenis | One global smooth scroll |
| GSAP + ScrollTrigger | Cinema: pin, scrub, timelines, reveals |
| Framer Motion | UI chrome enter/exit only |
| R3F / Three | Accents (fog, particles, neon) |

- Never drive the **same property** with GSAP + Framer + CSS together
- CSS OK for simple hover/focus
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: static finals; no smooth Lenis; no pin theater
- Isolate one concern per island; dispose/kill on unmount
